Mastering DevSecOps - Integrating Security Seamlessly
Learning Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

• Implement a complete CI/CD pipeline with integrated security scanning tools • Configure Static Application Security Testing (SAST) using SonarQube • Set up Software Composition Analysis (SCA) using OWASP Dependency-Check • Perform Dynamic Application Security Testing (DAST) using OWASP ZAP • Create and scan Infrastructure as Code (IaC) templates using Terraform and TFSec • Centralize vulnerability management using DefectDojo • Validate compliance using InSpec • Deploy applications securely in Kubernetes • Implement incident response automation using Falco • Understand the complete DevSecOps workflow and security integration points

Prerequisites
